<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SoundWave — 로그인</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/variables.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/auth.css">
  <style>
    body  { display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;background:var(--bg-base) }
    .wrap { width:100%;max-width:420px;padding:24px }
    .logo { text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px }
    .logo-icon { width:56px;height:56px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 12px }
    .logo-text { font-size:24px;font-weight:900 }
    .card { background:var(--bg-surface);border-radius:var(--radius-xl);padding:32px 28px;box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.07) }
    .title    { font-size:22px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:4px }
    .subtitle { font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:24px }
    .fg       { margin-bottom:16px }
    .fg label { display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-secondary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px }
    .fg input { width:100%;background:var(--bg-mid);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-base);font-family:var(--font);outline:none;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s }
    .fg input:focus { border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(30,215,96,.15) }
    .btn  { width:100%;background:var(--accent);border:none;color:#000;padding:13px;border-radius:var(--radius-full);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;margin-top:4px;transition:background .15s,transform .15s }
    .btn:hover { background:#1bc451;transform:scale(1.01) }
    .err  { background:rgba(243,114,127,.1);border:1px solid rgba(243,114,127,.3);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--negative);margin-bottom:14px }
    .suc  { background:rgba(30,215,96,.1);border:1px solid rgba(30,215,96,.3);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px }
    .demo { background:rgba(30,215,96,.06);border:1px solid rgba(30,215,96,.15);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:12px 14px;margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;text-align:center }
    .demo strong { color:var(--text-base) }
    .foot { text-align:center;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary) }
    .foot a { color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none }
    .socials { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px }
    .social-btn { display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
                  border-radius:var(--radius-full);padding:11px;font-size:13px;
                  font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font) }
    .social-btn.google { background:#fff;color:#1a1a1a;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1) }
    .social-btn.naver  { background:#03C75A;color:#fff;border:none }
    .divider { display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:18px 0;
               font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted) }
    .divider::before, .divider::after { content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1) }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="logo">
    <div class="logo-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="#000" width="26" height="26">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <path d="M12.5 10.5v11l9-5.5-9-5.5z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-text">SoundWave</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="title">다시 만나요!</div>
    <div class="subtitle">로그인해서 음악을 즐겨보세요</div>
    {{#errorMsg}}<div class="err">{{errorMsg}}</div>{{/errorMsg}}
    {{#successMsg}}<div class="suc">{{successMsg}}</div>{{/successMsg}}

    <div class="socials">
      <a href="/api/oauth/google" class="social-btn google">
        <span style="font-weight:900;color:#4285F4">G</span> Google로 계속하기
      </a>
      <a href="/api/oauth/naver" class="social-btn naver">
        <span style="font-weight:900">N</span> 네이버로 계속하기
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="divider">또는 이메일로 로그인</div>

    <form action="/login" method="post">
      <div class="fg">
        <label for="email">이메일</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="이메일을 입력하세요" required autocomplete="email">
      </div>
      <div class="fg">
        <label for="password">비밀번호</label>
        <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력하세요" required>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">로그인</button>
    </form>
    <div class="demo">🎵 데모 계정: <strong>demo@soundwave.kr</strong> / <strong>demo1234</strong></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot">계정이 없으신가요? <a href="/signup">회원가입</a></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
